This directory is a PLACEHOLDER. Nothing in it describes a real deployment.

It exists so the layout, the tools and the workflows can be reviewed before the
first release is published. While this file exists:
  * tools/validate_deployments.py reports the directory as "placeholder";
  * history/record.py verifies without a policy, so every run is INCOMPLETE and
    "matches no release" - the scheduled workflow stays disabled until then.

To publish the first release, follow deployments/README.md ("Publishing a
release"): tools/prepare_release.py with --retire-placeholder writes the real
release directory, removes this one, and updates CURRENT and CHANGELOG.md.
